CBittorrent native macOS build
=============================

Supported target: macOS 27 or newer, Apple Silicon (arm64) only.
Required build tools: Xcode with macOS 27+ SDK, Python 3.9+, pkg-config.
Required engine library: libtorrent-rasterbar >= 2.1 and < 3 with its Boost/OpenSSL headers.
Qt is not required or used by the native application.

    brew install libtorrent-rasterbar pkg-config
    ./native/build.sh
    open build/native/CBittorrent.app

Optional CMake entry point (same native build and dependency audit):

    brew install cmake ninja
    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja
    cmake --build build

The build copies non-system dynamic libraries into the app and signs the result
ad hoc. It does not install into /Applications, modify Homebrew libraries, or
notarize the app. See native/README.md for validation and migration scope.
